  <item>
    <title>12、年中特辑：谁还不会给自己画饼？用平衡轮给人生开挂</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667e8b2a9c477b6102e481ef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667e8b2a9c477b6102e481ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Jun 2024 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>今天给大家分享一种系统的、有画面感的工具，它能够帮助你在觉知生活的方方面面的基础上，以清晰容易实践的方式，实现“大有趣为”的人生状态。</span></blockquote><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 平衡轮工具的基本介绍</span></h4><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> Part 1：你给当前生活，各个部分满意度打几分？</span></h4><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">04:58</a> 哪些事情满意度高达 9分</span></h4><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">06:57</a> 在努力经营中向好发展：满意度 7-8分</span></strong></p><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 下半年重点发力？ 满意度 6分及以下</span></h4><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1423">23:43</a> Part 2：提升下半年整体满意度的撬动点在哪里？</span></h4><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> Part 3：愿景展望 —— “每个人都该学会给自己画饼”</span></strong></p><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> Part 4：呼之欲出的行动思路</span></h4><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2018">33:38</a> 平衡轮工具 使用真实体感</span></h4><span></span><h4><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2252">37:32</a> 教程指引</span></h4><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1pD00K3gpWOi1rLstJcZY0DD0C.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>平衡轮使用教程及相关资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《转念的奇迹》 第16章 </span><a href="https://weread.qq.com/book-detail?type=1&amp;senderVid=2133427&amp;v=8c3322e0813ab8e16g01702f&amp;wtheme=white&amp;wfrom=app&amp;wvid=2133427&amp;scene=bottomSheetShare" data-url="https://weread.qq.com/book-detail?type=1&amp;senderVid=2133427&amp;v=8c3322e0813ab8e16g01702f&amp;wtheme=white&amp;wfrom=app&amp;wvid=2133427&amp;scene=bottomSheetShare"><span>weread.qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎来唠嗑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgD5vPOFn8MeBVgDayC4UcMyYXgf.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
