    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f0f5ba6c4561bc2102e2a7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>Gap Year 一整年，帮云南的NGO卖茶叶、种香水柠檬。她说，没有绝对的好工作，也没有绝对正确的选择。你一定要尝试了才不后悔，反正人只活一次</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：Yan Ling</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>5年大厂HR，旅居云南Gap Year中</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkTafMM6dZA5vZK9xMi5RGltxSSZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>创意制作人：顺顺（@西湖后花园）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> 钱多事少不加班的工作为啥不要了？</span></h3><span></span><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a> 意义感驱动下在NGO工作都做些啥？</span></strong></h3><span></span><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">18:12</a> 给企业和NGO打工有什么不同？</span></strong></h3><span></span><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a> 从深圳到云南，我发现女性属于城市</span></strong></h3><span></span><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 好好体验这个世界，是送给打工四年自己的礼物 （关于未来计划）</span></strong></h3><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a> 结尾彩蛋——还是要多发朋友圈</span></h3><span></span><p><span>欢迎来唠嗑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqjBTdsJfrbhKf9mufOZSyd0xWJZ.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
