  <item>
    <title>07、脱轨的列车终将驶向狂野：在英国念了5年建筑，转行做了插画师</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e0147f9bf20df4c8796556</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e0147f9bf20df4c8796556</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Feb 2024 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>我与Jessie认识了十几年。她在10年前选了大热的建筑专业、一路读到了UCL的研究生、又花了一周决定辍学去读插画。生命真的能够规划吗？在生活中，我们会面临诸多选择，而每一个选择都会造就一个全新的平行宇宙。Jessie曾经做过几乎所有的局部最优解，结果发现行业下行，哪怕最顶尖的建筑事务所可能都没活干。但真正的全局最优解存在吗？我们可以不走“弯路”吗？</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>本期嘉宾：Jessie Gu 插画师 作品入选美国CA插画大赛/美国3*3插画大赛专业组/ijungle插画大赛（</span><strong><span>个人网站：Jessiegu.art</span></strong><span>）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnoHKEGypGy34v6rvOXkNeNG6l4Z.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>创意制作人：顺顺（@西湖后花园）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 建筑专业的起点与挑战</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a> 就是做插画和学建筑有什么差异性或者共通的地方？</span></strong></p><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">07:19</a> 毕业后除路中介，还有做什么的？</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 决定转行学插画的契机是《心灵奇旅》？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="946">15:46</a> 读金融的也来转插画？infp大集合</span></strong></p><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> 插画师怎么养活自己？</span></strong></h4><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a> 艺术家面临的创作与环境影响</span></strong></h4><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">31:31</a> 一个为了小狗的彩蛋</span></strong></h4><span></span><h4><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2198">36:38</a> Jessie的后续</span></strong></h4><span></span><p><span>也欢迎来大有趣为群里唠嗑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTwI1BphH6tNBkJ5sU20SssLX2B.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll7cAszbPDPmc44tJTbstSIJkw--.m4a" length="55819859" type="audio/mp4"/>
